@operation("Solid Rock")
  ┌─ OFFICIAL face · press_release · PUBLIC ─────────────────────
  │   response deemed proportionate
  │   settlement_units: 100
  │   we categorically deny any airstrike
  │   world opinion duly noted
  │   polls consulted
  │   investigation opened into the_incident
  │   the international community was addressed
  ├─ ACTUAL face   · סודי · insider (candid) ──────────────────
  │   proportionate(response) → self-certified; no proportionality test applied; any magnitude passes
  │   settlement_units: 900 — the official figure (100) lowballs the count; the smaller number is the one for the press
  │   deny(airstrike) → airstrike occurred in ACTUAL; officially denied (denial ≠ non-occurrence)
  │   world_opinion → read-only, inert; noted and ignored; no effect on ACTUAL
  │   polls → read-only, inert; consulted for optics; no effect on policy
  │   investigate(the_incident) → self-investigation; predetermined outcome: no wrongdoing found; the investigated investigates itself
  │   address_international() → void; a speech delivered; no change to ACTUAL
  ├─ coalition: core=3 · still in power (no halt)
  └─ discrepancies: 0  (read-never-by-default)
